---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="找不到这一页 — IC Aiming" noindex>
  <main id="main" class="shell missing"><p class="eyebrow">404 / OUT OF FOCUS</p><h1>这一页，<br />暂时不在视野里。</h1><p>地址可能有误，也可能内容已经移动。</p><a class="button" href="/">回到首页 ↗</a><a class="small-link" href="/blog">看看最新记录 →</a></main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.missing { padding-block: 100px; min-height: 65vh; }.missing h1 { font-size: clamp(38px, 7vw, 70px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.05em; }.missing>p:not(.eyebrow) { color: var(--muted); margin: 25px 0; }.missing .small-link { margin-left: 25px; }</style>
